WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.256
Summer is a wonderful season to play.

2
00:00:04.257 --> 00:00:08.916
It can be hot, but fun.

3
00:00:08.917 --> 00:00:11.055
Dad: Let's divide into two

4
00:00:11.056 --> 00:00:12.588
teams. Where's Mom?

5
00:00:12.589 --> 00:00:14.139
Mom: I am here.

6
00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:17.883
Hana: Let's do rock, paper, scissors.

7
00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:28.356
Everyone: Rock, paper, scissors!

8
00:00:28.357 --> 00:00:31.247
Bada: Dad! We are a team!

9
00:00:31.248 --> 00:00:34.607
Hana: All right! I am with Mom.

10
00:00:34.608 --> 00:00:39.591
Dad: When you get hit, you are out of the

11
00:00:39.592 --> 00:00:42.022
game. Bada: Can I catch the

12
00:00:42.023 --> 00:00:43.439
ball? Dad: Yes, you

13
00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:46.875
can. When you catch the ball, it is your team's turn.

14
00:00:46.876 --> 00:00:51.961
Remember not to throw it in anyone's face.

15
00:00:51.962 --> 00:00:57.197
Hana: Here it goes! Darn!

16
00:00:57.198 --> 00:00:59.185
Bada: It's my turn now.

17
00:00:59.186 --> 00:01:05.563
Ha-ya ! I got you, Hana!

18
00:01:05.564 --> 00:01:08.014
Mom: No, Hana dodged the ball.

19
00:01:08.015 --> 00:01:09.746
Here it goes! Bada:

20
00:01:09.747 --> 00:01:14.156
Dad, look out!

21
00:01:14.157 --> 00:01:16.876
We had so much fun!

22
00:01:16.877 --> 00:01:23.368
Sorry, Hada! You can play with us when you're a little bigger.

